WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:14.420
A mature configuration management program includes defined baselines, documented assets, change control procedures, monitoring processes, configuration reviews, accountability, and continuous improvement activities.

2
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.500
Effective programs balance operational flexibility with governance and security requirements.

3
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:24.400
The goal is not to prevent change; the goal is to manage change responsibly.

4
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:35.160
Teams should define ownership, decide how baselines are approved, establish how changes are requested and reviewed, and monitor whether actual configurations match expectations.

5
00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.360
Over time, configuration management should become part of normal operations.

6
00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:46.660
When it is treated as a living process, it supports security, stability, compliance readiness, and risk management.
